math/Region.hpp is a public header and includes <pixman.h>, which lives in
/usr/include/pixman-1. hyprutils.pc declares no Requires, so consumers never
get pixman's include path and fail with "pixman.h: No such file or directory"
even when they depend on pixman-devel themselves.

--- a/hyprutils.pc.in
+++ b/hyprutils.pc.in
@@ -6,5 +6,6 @@
 URL: https://github.com/hyprwm/hyprutils
 Description: Hyprland utilities library used across the ecosystem 
 Version: @HYPRUTILS_VERSION@
+Requires: pixman-1
 Cflags: -I${includedir}
 Libs: -L${libdir} -lhyprutils
